The defect (orchestrator, 2026-11-18)
  `harness/model-guide/review-run.sh` line 242 builds the diff list from
  `$SET_DIR/src/*.diff`, and line 238 checks the `src` folder. The `src`
  folder holds the source diffs (`review-set.ts` line 18, `leak-check.ts`
  line 38). The seeded diffs are in `diffs/` (spec D7). A pass that reads
  `src/` sends unseeded code to the model, so every plant of a diff counts
  as missed.

